$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 2,3:20,22-Bis-O-[(1R)-ethylidene]-20-hydroxyecdyzone (XII). A suspension
of 1.0 g (2.08 mmol) of compound I and 125 ml of acetic aldehyde was
stirred at 2 °C till complete dissolution of compound I (~72 h), then 4.0
mg of PMA was added, and the mixture was stirred at ~25 °C for10 min,150
ml of water was added, and the product was extracted into AcOEt (3x200
ml). The extract was washed with water, evaporated in a vacuum, and the
residue was subjected to column chromatography (100 g of SiO2, eluent
CHCl3-MeOH, 30:1). 0.98 g (88%) of compound XII. Rf 0.5 (CHCl3-MeOH,
10:1), mp 113-115°C, [α] D 19 44.1° (C 3.23, CHCl3). IR spectrum (KBr),
ν, cm-1: 3450, 1720, 1655. UV spectrum, λmax, nm: 242. 1H NMR spectrum
(CDCl3), δ, ppm (J, Hz): 0.77 s (3H, H3C 18 ), 0.93 s (3H, H3C 19 ), 1.10
s (3H, H3C 21 ), 1.19 s and 1.20 s (6H, H3C 26 and H3C 27 ), 1.33 d (3H,
CH3C 1' , 3 J 5.0), 1.38 d (3H, CH3C 1' , 3 J 5.0), 1.46-2.47 m (18H, CH,
CH2), 2.72 m (1H, HC 9 , w1/2 22), 3.57 m (1H, HC 22 , w1/2 14), 4.07 m
(1H, HC 3 , w1/2 12), 4.15 m (1H, HC 2 , w1/2 30), 5.04 q (1H, HC 1' , 3
J 5.0), 5.09 q (1H, HC 1' , 3 J 5.0), 5.77 br.s (1H, HC 7 , w1/2 5). 13C
NMR spectrum (CDCl3), δ, ppm: 16.6 q (C 18 ), 20.4 t (C 11 ), 21.3t (C 11
), 21.4 q and 21.5 q (CH3C 1' and CH3C 1" ) 22.9 q (C 21 ), 23.3t (C 23
), 23.4 q (C 19 ), 26.5 t (C 15 ), 29.1 q and 29.5 q (C 26 and C 27 ),
30.6 t (C 12 ), 31.3t (CR), 34.6 d (C 9 ), 37.6 s (C 10 ), 38.3t (C 1 ),
41.2 t (C 24 ), 47.2 s (C 13 ), 49.6 d (C 17 ), 50.1 d (C 5 ), 70.4 s (C
25 ), 71.5 d (C 3 ), 73.6 d (C 2 ), 83.8 s (C 20 ), 84.2 d (C 22 ), 84.5
s (C 1 R), 101.0 d (C 1' ), 101.4 d (C 1'' ), 121.1 d (C 7 ), 164.0 s (C
8 ), 203.0 s (C 6 ). Found, %: C 70.18; H 9.22. C31H4SO7. Calculated, %:
C 69.90; H 9.08.
