0.98 (t, 1.5H, J =7.3 Hz); 13C NMR (75 MHz, CDCl3) δ 159.7, 159.5, 13
1.1, 129.9, 127.9, 127.6, 114.0, 104.8, 103.8, 85.6, 84.1, 80.8, 78.9,
55.3, 36.9, 36.8, 17.2, 17.18, 17.0, 16.2, 14.1, 14.07; MS m/z : 236
(M+), 192 (100%); HRMS (EI) calcd for C14H20O3 (M+): 236.1412, found:
